{"id":63028,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=63028"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:18:28","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:18:28","slug":"trail-pedra-da-ferida","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-pedra-da-ferida\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Pedra da Ferida 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Pedra da Ferida 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Pedra da Ferida 2026<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Vila do Espinhal<\/strong>, concelho de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Penela<\/strong> (distrito de Coimbra). Situada no cora\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Serra do Espinhal<\/strong> e ladeada pelas imponentes serras da Lous\u00e3 e de Sic\u00f3, esta prova convida-te a desafiar trilhos t\u00e9cnicos de montanha rodeados por quedas de \u00e1gua, ribeiros e bosque aut\u00f3ctone. Para planeares a tua gest\u00e3o de esfor\u00e7o nas subidas mais exigentes, podes recorrer \u00e0 nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e explorar mais desafios no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail-running\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partidas e meta instaladas na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Vila do Espinhal<\/strong> e secretariado no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Parque da Quinta da Cerca<\/strong>, o evento disp\u00f5e de tr\u00eas desafios circulares: o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Curto de 20 km<\/strong> (1000m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:15), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini Trail de 13 km<\/strong> (600m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:45) e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> (400m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:50). Ao longo do tra\u00e7ado vais cruzar ex-l\u00edbris naturais e hist\u00f3ricos da freguesia, incluindo o Calv\u00e1rio do Espinhal, o Rio Sim\u00e3o, a emblem\u00e1tica <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Cascata da Pedra da Ferida<\/strong>, a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Praia Fluvial da Lou\u00e7ainha<\/strong>, a pitoresca Aldeia das Relvas, P\u00e9 de Esquio e, no percurso de 20 km, o espa\u00e7o sereno de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o do Deserto<\/strong> e Pessegueiro.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Promovido e organizado pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Penela<\/strong> (atrav\u00e9s do seu N\u00facleo Cultural), com o apoio da Junta de Freguesia do Espinhal e do Munic\u00edpio de Penela, o evento alia a competi\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva a uma forte miss\u00e3o solid\u00e1ria na angaria\u00e7\u00e3o de fundos para equipamentos de socorro. O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail Curto de 20 km<\/strong> integra oficialmente o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Circuito Distrital de Trail Running de Coimbra<\/strong> (ADAC), garantindo aos participantes t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro desportivo, pr\u00e9mios finisher e refei\u00e7\u00e3o ligeira conv\u00edvio no final.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong clas