t-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 16\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 18,00 \u20ac (16,50 \u20ac ADAC)<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 07\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 09:50 \u2022 400m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 16\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 07\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Pedra da Ferida 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail Pedra da Ferida realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partidas e meta na Vila do Espinhal, concelho de Penela (distrito de Coimbra). O Trail Curto (20 km) parte \u00e0s 09:15, o Mini Trail (13 km) \u00e0s 09:45 e a Caminhada (10 km) \u00e0s 09:50.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 16 de outubro de 2026), os valores s\u00e3o de 19,00 \u20ac no Trail Curto 20 km (17,50 \u20ac para atletas ADAC), 16,00 \u20ac no Mini Trail 13 km (14,50 \u20ac ADAC) e 12,00 \u20ac na Caminhada 10 km. Na 2\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 7 de novembro de 2026), os pre\u00e7os passam para 21,00 \u20ac (19,50 \u20ac ADAC) nos 20 km, 18,00 \u20ac (16,50 \u20ac ADAC) nos 13 km e 13,00 \u20ac na Caminhada. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro, abastecimentos, pr\u00e9mio finisher e refei\u00e7\u00e3o ligeira (sopa, bifana e bebida).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Parque da Quinta da Cerca, no Espinhal (Penela), no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro de 2026, das 15:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, dia da prova (15 de novembro), das 07:00 \u00e0s 09:00. \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3ria a apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do Cart\u00e3o de Cidad\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio para os atletas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Curto de 20 km tem um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 5h00 (com barreira hor\u00e1ria aos 12 km \u00e0s 3h30 de prova), enquanto o Mini Trail de 13 km disp\u00f5e de 4h00. \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica (m\u00edn. 140x200 cm) e copo reutiliz\u00e1vel (m\u00edn. 12 cl), uma vez que n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail Pedra da Ferida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 promovido e organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Penela, atrav\u00e9s do seu N\u00facleo Cultural, com o apoio da Junta de Freguesia do Espinhal e do Munic\u00edpio de Penela, revertendo a favor da aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de equipamentos de socorro. A prova de 20 km integra o Circuito Distrital de Trail Running de Coimbra (ADAC).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Pedra da Ferida 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Espinhal, Penela\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Penela\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail Pedra da Ferida 2026 realiza-se a 15 de novembro no Espinhal, Penela. Corre nos trilhos de 20 km, 13 km ou caminhada de 10 km. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-pedra-da-ferida.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto 20 km\", \"price\": \"19.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-pedra-da-ferida-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini Trail 13 km\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-pedra-da-ferida-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 10 km\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trail-pedra-da-ferida-2026\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Pedra da Ferida 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail Pedra da Ferida realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partidas e meta na Vila do Espinhal, concelho de Penela (distrito de Coimbra). O Trail Curto (20 km) parte \u00e0s 09:15, o Mini Trail (13 km) \u00e0s 09:45 e a Caminhada (10 km) \u00e0s 09:50.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 16 de outubro de 2026), os valores s\u00e3o de 19,00 \u20ac no Trail Curto 20 km (17,50 \u20ac para atletas ADAC), 16,00 \u20ac no Mini Trail 13 km (14,50 \u20ac ADAC) e 12,00 \u20ac na Caminhada 10 km. Na 2\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 7 de novembro de 2026), os pre\u00e7os passam para 21,00 \u20ac (19,50 \u20ac ADAC) nos 20 km, 18,00 \u20ac (16,50 \u20ac ADAC) nos 13 km e 13,00 \u20ac na Caminhada. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro, abastecimentos, pr\u00e9mio finisher e refei\u00e7\u00e3o ligeira (sopa, bifana e bebida).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no Parque da Quinta da Cerca, no Espinhal (Penela), no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro de 2026, das 15:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, dia da prova (15 de novembro), das 07:00 \u00e0s 09:00. \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3ria a apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do Cart\u00e3o de Cidad\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio para os atletas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Curto de 20 km tem um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 5h00 (com barreira hor\u00e1ria aos 12 km \u00e0s 3h30 de prova), enquanto o Mini Trail de 13 km disp\u00f5e de 4h00. \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica (m\u00edn. 140x200 cm) e copo reutiliz\u00e1vel (m\u00edn. 12 cl), uma vez que n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem \u00e9 a entidade respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail Pedra da Ferida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 promovido e organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Penela, atrav\u00e9s do seu N\u00facleo Cultural, com o apoio da Junta de Freguesia do Espinhal e do Munic\u00edpio de Penela, revertendo a favor da aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de equipamentos de socorro. A prova de 20 km integra o Circuito Distrital de Trail Running de Coimbra (ADAC).\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69630,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-63028","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-penela-coimbra","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-coimbra","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/c